{"book":"2chronicles","num":18,"verses":[{"en":"Now Jehoshaphat had riches and honour in abundance, and joined affinity with Ahab.","n":1,"sm":"O le fefaaucaiga o Iosefatu ma Aapo Sa tele le oa ma le mamalu ia Iosefatu; ua fetaiai foi o laua gafa ma Aapo.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fefaaucaiga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Iosefatu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Aapo"},{"en":"","sm":"Sa"},{"en":"","sm":"tele"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"oa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mamalu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Iosefatu;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetaiai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"laua"},{"en":"","sm":"gafa"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Aapo."}]},{"en":"And after certain years he went down to Ahab to Samaria. And Ahab killed sheep and oxen for him in abundance, and for the people that he had with him, and persuaded him to go up with him to Ramoth-gilead.","n":2,"sm":"Ua mavae nai tausaga, ona alu ifo ai lea o ia ia Aapo i Samaria. Ona fasia lea e Aapo o mamoe ma povi e tele, e tali ai o ia, ma le nuu na ia te ia; ma ua faaoso ia te ia ia la o ae i Ramota-Kiliata.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"mavae"},{"en":"","sm":"nai"},{"en":"","sm":"tausaga,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ifo"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Aapo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Samaria."},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"fasia"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Aapo"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"mamoe"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"povi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tele,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tali"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"nuu"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","s