d of the LORD to day.","n":4,"sm":"Ua fai atu foi Iosefatu i le tupu o Isaraelu, Seʻi e saili i le aso nei i se afioga mai le Aw.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"Iosefatu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu,"},{"en":"","sm":"Seʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"saili"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"nei"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"afioga"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Aw."}]},{"en":"Therefore the king of Israel gathered together of prophets four hundred men, and said unto them, Shall we go to Ramoth-gilead to battle, or shall I forbear? And they said, Go up; for God will deliver it into the king's hand.","n":5,"sm":"Ona faapotopoto mai ai lea e le tupu o Isaraelu o le au perofeta e toafa selau o tagata, ma ua fai atu ia te i latou, Pe matou te o ae ea Ramota-Kiliata e tau ai le taua, pe aua? Ona latou fai mai lea, Maliu ae ia, aua e tuuina mai ai e le Atua i le aao o le tupu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"faapotopoto"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"perofeta"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toafa"},{"en":"","sm":"selau"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou,"},{"en":"","sm":"Pe"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ae"},{"en":"","sm":"ea"},{"en":"","sm":"Ramota-Kiliata"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tau"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taua,"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":